Feb 1675 (prov. 30 May 1677), will, Thomas Todd of Baltimore County, son Thomas Todd exec. - wife Ann Todd - mentioned Richard Booth in London + Robert Gorsedg (in old England) - four daughters: Ann + Johanna + Frances + Averelea - brother Christopher Todd - witn. ? Myloon + Symond Whitthall
22 Sep 1675 (prov. 23 Mar 1675), will, Richard Pherrell of the County of Baltimore, wife Margaret Pherrell

